* {{alt|en|Keralam}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|ml|കേരളം}} which is of uncertain origin. One popular theory derives the name from {{der|en|ml|t=coconut tree|കേരം}} and {{der|en|ml|അളം|t=land}}, thus "land of coconuts", which is also the state's nickname. More at [[w:Kerala#Etymology|Kerala]].

